 "summary": "A red, green and blue LED die set sharing one package with a 68-series control IC. Each device reads a 24-bit colour word from a single return-to-zero data line, sets 256 brightness steps per colour with PWM, and passes the rest of the stream on from DOUT, so any number of devices can be chained. It runs from 3.7 V to 5.5 V with each colour channel sinking about 12 mA.",
